  "summary_en": "Jamaica's 2015 Government Communication Policy, issued by the Office of the Prime Minister, sets vision, principles and strategies for how ministries, departments and agencies communicate with citizens, covering information access, branding, research and feedback, risk and crisis communication, and new media. It does not address AI or robotics, despite the collector's title.",
